          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<html>\n  <head>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Problem Solving</h1>\n    <h3> Introduction </h3>\n    <p> Have you ever been in a situation where people are talking about something you know nothing about? Because I know I have. Many times people will mention a person, a place, a word that I have never heard before and I just cannot participate in the conversation which sucks.</p>\n    <h3> What Can I do? </h3>\n    <p> For me, there are a couple of things that I do to try and help make the situation better for me that include: </p>\n    <h3> Googling It </h3>\n    <p> Sometimes just going to <a href=\"https://www.google.com/\"> Google</a> and just doing a quick search of they are talking about is enough to give me some information about it. </p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": true,
          "folderId": "0"
        }
